% Fibre names
"polyester" is a word for the textile material polyester,
    as stated in the fibre names regulation, confer "polyester".
"cotton" is a word for the textile material cotton,
    as stated in the fibre names regulation, confer "cotton".
"wool" is a word for the textile material wool,
    as stated in the fibre names regulation, confer "wool".
